  "translation": "Today is the weekend. My friend and I went to the park together. In the morning, we first went to a lake on the east side of the park. There were many fish in the lake, and also flowers. These flowers were very beautiful. We walked for a long time, got a bit tired, and then rested on the benches by the lake. We sat in front of the benches, under the trees it was very cool. After lunch, we went to a restaurant on the south side of the park to eat lunch. The lunch was very delicious. In the afternoon, we rented a bicycle. I can ride a bike, and we rode together around the park. We could see many scenery, everything looked beautiful. In the evening, we went home. Today was truly a happy day!"
